    "type": "game",
    "name": "Baba Yaga",
    "steam_appid": 3154620,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turn-based strategy roguelike, you\u2019ll face hordes of loyalist forces who are after your head! Play as Baba Yaga, the enigmatic witch from Slavic folklore, and uncover her reimagined origin story within a dark medieval fantasy setting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/d3325e541a528de017aa0bc1c18381dd.poster.avif?t=1741896397\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/d3325e541a528de017aa0bc1c18381dd.webm?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/d3325e541a528de017aa0bc1c18381dd.mp4?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each turn, your enemies draw nearer\u2026 Plan your moves carefully, and eliminate each wave to progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from a wide variety of spells to expand your dark magic arsenal. Will you cripple your foe? Bolster yourself? Rain down destruction? No two spells are the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Draw power from three separate mana pools of Hatred, Sorrow, and Spite - use your resources efficiently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Seek synergies, exploit weaknesses, and unleash raw diabolical power!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/3003416858e3ca903320579c72269846.poster.avif?t=1741896397\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/3003416858e3ca903320579c72269846.webm?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/3003416858e3ca903320579c72269846.mp4?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each run is unique and procedurally generated. It takes up to 30 minutes to complete a run, so you can experiment freely and learn faster. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Learn from your mistakes, master the game mechanics, and explore new choices every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each potential encounter has different enemy types and rewards: spells, mana upgrades, or powerful perks. Choose your path wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You will be offered a changing set of spells and perks in every run. Test new builds, and remake the witch you wish to be.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ascend through higher difficulty modes that provide novel challenges, even for seasoned players!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/097b15758ce0784c843cf39975dbf28f.poster.avif?t=1741896397\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/097b15758ce0784c843cf39975dbf28f.webm?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/097b15758ce0784c843cf39975dbf28f.mp4?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve into an emotional story that takes you to the seven circles of hell itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > See through the eyes of a villain in an age of strife and chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rediscover Baba Yaga: originating from Slavic folklore, she is often depicted as an old witch. This is her reimagined origin story, set in the days of her youth - a tale of love lost, demonic deals, and furious vengeance.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this turn-based strategy roguelike, you\u2019ll face hordes of loyalist forces who are after your head! Play as Baba Yaga, the enigmatic witch from Slavic folklore, and uncover her reimagined origin story within a dark medieval fantasy setting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/d3325e541a528de017aa0bc1c18381dd.poster.avif?t=1741896397\" width=600 height=94 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/d3325e541a528de017aa0bc1c18381dd.webm?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/d3325e541a528de017aa0bc1c18381dd.mp4?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each turn, your enemies draw nearer\u2026 Plan your moves carefully, and eliminate each wave to progress through the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Choose from a wide variety of spells to expand your dark magic arsenal. Will you cripple your foe? Bolster yourself? Rain down destruction? No two spells are the same!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Draw power from three separate mana pools of Hatred, Sorrow, and Spite - use your resources efficiently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Seek synergies, exploit weaknesses, and unleash raw diabolical power!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/3003416858e3ca903320579c72269846.poster.avif?t=1741896397\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/3003416858e3ca903320579c72269846.webm?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/3003416858e3ca903320579c72269846.mp4?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each run is unique and procedurally generated. It takes up to 30 minutes to complete a run, so you can experiment freely and learn faster. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Learn from your mistakes, master the game mechanics, and explore new choices every time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Each potential encounter has different enemy types and rewards: spells, mana upgrades, or powerful perks. Choose your path wisely!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > You will be offered a changing set of spells and perks in every run. Test new builds, and remake the witch you wish to be.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Ascend through higher difficulty modes that provide novel challenges, even for seasoned players!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/097b15758ce0784c843cf39975dbf28f.poster.avif?t=1741896397\" width=600 height=92 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/097b15758ce0784c843cf39975dbf28f.webm?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3154620/extras/097b15758ce0784c843cf39975dbf28f.mp4?t=1741896397\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Delve into an emotional story that takes you to the seven circles of hell itself.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > See through the eyes of a villain in an age of strife and chaos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Rediscover Baba Yaga: originating from Slavic folklore, she is often depicted as an old witch. This is her reimagined origin story, set in the days of her youth - a tale of love lost, demonic deals, and furious vengeance.</p></li></ul>",
